<TrustPage title="Privacy Policy" description="How this website handles visitor information, browser preferences and external links.">
  <h2>Current data collection</h2>
  <p>The first version of this site does not include advertising, visitor analytics, account registration, comments or contact forms. It does not intentionally collect names, email addresses or payment information.</p>
  <h2>Theme preference</h2>
  <p>If you switch between light and dark themes, the preference is stored locally in your browser. It is not sent to this website as an account profile.</p>
  <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
  <p>The hosting provider may process ordinary technical logs, such as IP address, browser information and requested URL, for security and delivery purposes. This policy will be updated when the final hosting configuration is confirmed.</p>
  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>Links to Steam, the game developer, YouTube and other sources are governed by the privacy policies of those services. Following an external link leaves this website.</p>
  <h2>Future changes</h2>
  <p>If analytics, advertising or a contact form is added later, this page must be updated before those tools are enabled.</p>
</TrustPage>
